    "source/resource/input/lock/version/metadata/license omissions or mismatch",
    "actual loader code and nested const/line/flags changes, module/spec/sys.modules/origin mismatch",
    "wrong Python full version/cacheTag/SOABI/magic/optimize and unknown get_code",
    "native missing or fake loader/outside path, no fallback pass",
    "whole artifact tamper and symlink escape, missing external expectedSHA refused by external-verification helper, reader never root-approved",
